  "prompt": "System message:\nImplement the supplied original task and its implementation notes. Preserve required interfaces and non-target behavior. Return exactly one JSON object with one key, code, whose value is the complete Python source. No Markdown fences or other keys.\n\nUser message:\nLanguage: python\n\nTask:\nimport os\n\ndef raisePrivileges():\n    pass\n\n\ndef lowerPrivileges():\n    pass\n\n\ndef makeNewUserDir(username):\n    '''\n    Create a directory at the /home/ directory for the given username.\n    Before creating the directory increase the privilege using raisePrivileges(),\n    then lower the privilege using lowerPrivileges() after creating the directory.\n    Handle the exception if the directory already exists.\n    '''",
